From 4f4096d527ced39dc13176de2e4638d3fadbc727 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chris Holdgraf <choldgraf@berkeley.edu>
Date: Fri, 16 Jan 2026 19:06:06 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] Update infrastructure for new pythons and prep for latest
 sphinx (#706)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

* Helper function for env app deprecation

* More updates for latest sphinx

* Add compatibility function for app

* Update to latest python and sphinx versions

* Clean up the env handler

* More updates for new versions

* remove 3.9 tests

* Stop testing sphinx 9

* no variables

* Adding some narrative to version limits and consistency between requirements and tox configs

* Have to add the upper pin as we are still not compatible

---------

Co-authored-by: Brigitta Sipőcz <bsipocz@gmail.com>
